n","witness_query_ns":"Selector workspace run and checked batch binding/count","original_verification_ns":"verification::verify_trajectory for both selected witnesses","end_to_end_strategy_ns":"Preparation start through completion of both original-data witness checks; inclusive total, not a sum of other measured phases"},"phase_counters_unavailable":["Internal LP/convex, projection, affine-sum, conversion, hull-membership and verifier subphase durations/call counts are not exposed by these public APIs.","CPU time and per-call peak memory are not measured by this timing driver."]}
